msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're the man from before. It looks like you're getting\r\n"
"pretty friendly with that beautiful brunette, wink wink!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "You've been watching us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"That's not what's important. What really matters is your\r\n"
"heart... Listen, you'd like to be more intimate with a female\r\n"
"companion in more ways than one, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"So... Why don't you buy our Love Handbook right now for\r\n"
"55,000 yen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"I'm pretty sure the title says it all, if you know what I mean! So? Will "
"you take the plunge and witness your love life changed forever? Or are you "
"fine being bone dry?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"No thanks. I'm not really interested in learning any more\r\n"
"English."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"Are you sure? After all the trouble you went through to get to know her... "
"Wouldn't that be a waste?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Well, come back anytime if you decide to change your mind!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "55,000 yen... It should be all there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Mm, nice and crisp. Well, here's your Love Handbook. It's\r\n"
"practically a conversational Kama Sutra!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>55,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "You got an <Color:8>English Textbook on Dating<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "(Whew, okay. Here it is... \"Conversing in the Bedroom.\")"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Ｗｈｙ　ｄｏｎ'ｔ　ｙｏｕ　ｃｏｍｅ　ｔｏ\r\n"
" ｍｙ　ｒｏｏｍ？"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Ｌｅｔ'ｓ　ｍａｋｅ　ｓｗｅｅｔ，\r\n"
" ｐａｓｓｉｏｎａｔｅ　ｌｏｖｅ．"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"Now before you get too excited, remember... Whether she gives\r\n"
"you a ｙｅｓ or a ｎｏ depends on how smooth you are. Hehe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"Our English handbooks give you exactly what you need to know\r\n"
"so you can be the lover you're truly meant to be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"Now I hope you enjoy the course, and, as we say in English...\r\n"
"Ｈａｖｅ　ａ　ｎｉｃｅ　ｄａｙ！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Uh-oh. Looks like I don't have enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's okay. I'll save a copy for you, so please come\r\n"
"and find me when you have a little more to spend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're the man from before. Have you changed your mind?\r\n"
"Do you feel like learning English now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"You can buy the steamiest, the sultriest, the hottest edition\r\n"
"of romantic English grammar for the generous price of only\r\n"
"55,000 yen! Hurry, these Love Handbooks are selling out fast!"
msgstr ""

